<heading level="2">Logging and Monitoring</heading>

<table>
  <ched/>Log File<ched/>Contents<nl/>
  <fcel/><code>logs/trust_scores_new.csv</code><fcel/>Per-epoch trust weights (timestamp, observer, peer, weight)<nl/>
  <fcel/><code>logs/epoch_loss_tracking.csv</code><fcel/>Real-time per-step training loss (timestamp, node_id, epoch, step, loss)<nl/>
  <fcel/><code>logs/accuracy_scores.csv</code><fcel/>Per-round accuracy metrics<nl/>
  <fcel/><code>logs/ml_performance.csv</code><fcel/>Training performance (loss, perplexity per node per round)<nl/>
  <fcel/><code>logs/runtime_comm.log</code><fcel/>Structured runtime events (node_start, ray_started, delta_encoded, peer_delta_loaded, etc.)<nl/>
  <fcel/><code>logs/malicious_nodes.txt</code><fcel/>Detected malicious node identifiers<nl/>
</table>

